Package: popoashexceedance
Title: Exceedance Analysis of FALL3D Ash Deposit Forecasts for Popocatepetl
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("José Agustín", "García Reynoso", email = "agustin@atmosfera.unam.mx",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(affiliation = "Instituto de Ciencias de la Atmósfera y Cambio Climático, Universidad Nacional Autónoma de México (UNAM)"))
Maintainer: José Agustín García Reynoso <agustin@atmosfera.unam.mx>
Description: Scripts to compute the probability of exceedance of a ground ash
    deposit load threshold (default 0.1 kg/m2) from hourly FALL3D NetCDF
    outputs (Fall3D 7.1 for 2018-2023, whose files carry the attribute TITLE "Fall3d 7.2 results"; version 8 for 2024-2025), by scenario and year.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: ncdf4, yaml, data.table, ggplot2
